{"ts":"2026-08-13T17:10:52.114Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"337731c74a03807df397c95d","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-q6jk"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"A Dependabot bump to pm-cli 2026.8.10 turned the tracker's own history into a CI failure"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The bump PR was innocent: main was green and the diff touched only package.json and package-lock.json, but the health gate failed. pm health --strict-exit reported ok:false with a single non-ok check, and the cause was in the top-level warnings array rather than any check status: provenance_value_domain_invalid:claude-code:role:single_digit:19. Nineteen history events in this tracker carry agent_provenance.role.value of 1, written by pm-cli 2026.8.7 itself, which reads the CLAUDE_CODE_CHILD_SESSION boolean flag as the agent role. 2026.8.10 added a validation that treats those values as fatal; 2026.8.13 downgraded it to a non-fatal warning. Same bytes on disk, three different verdicts."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["correctness","toolchain"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-13T17:10:52.114Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-13T17:10:52.114Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"6e3bcee490f33924b9203e0088af9f039f9957515999974b2e0904a5baca623d","item_hash_version":2,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"